  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Modernisation of official statistics</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme provides high-quality technical assistance, mainly through experts from the UK Office for National Statistics, to build the capacity of statistical systems in developing countries. We have key partnerships with national statistical offices globally, primarily in Africa.</narrative>
